  displayName: Handling Evidence Points to Different Individuals
  description: The brother's fingerprint was recovered from the knife, while the
    wife's fingerprint was recovered from inside the gloves. The evidence connects
    different individuals to different objects, so object handling should not be
    treated as direct proof of who committed the attack.
